BreadcrumbLink.description:
A crumb: an <a>, or with `active: true` the current page - a non-interactive <span> with aria-current="page". `disabled: true` dims it and takes it out of the tab order. A block taking an argument receives the attributes for your own element (Appica's `render`):

  BreadcrumbLink(href: "/") { "Home" }
  BreadcrumbLink(href: "/", class: "…") { |crumb| Badge(**crumb, variant: :soft) { "Home" } }
